.SH AUTH ON ACTION HOOKS
An auth on action policy can ask for a login again before these actions.
See
.B Auth On Action Policy
in
.BR otpme\-policy (1).
A script has the hooks every object type has, and these:
.RS
.PP
.na
.nh
add_sign, del_sign, set_config_parameter, show_config_parameters, sign.
.hy
.ad
.RE
.\" END AUTH ON ACTION HOOKS
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/otpme/
OTPme data directory
